<title>DUBAI: Oman lifts September crude price to $21.20.</title>
<headline>Oman lifts September crude price to $21.20.</headline>
<dateline>DUBAI 1996-10-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Oman's Ministry of Petroleum and Minerals has raised the price of its crude lifted in September by $1.60 a barrel to $21.20, an official said on Sunday.</p>
<p>Oman term lifters had been calling for a cut in Oman's official selling price to reflect the value of Oman crude to regional benchmark crude Dubai.</p>
<p>-- Dubai Newsroom, +971 4 6071255.</p>
